      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "トレーナーの　きりょく　たいりょくを\nつかって　ポケモンが　Ｚパワーを\nはなてるようにする　ふしぎなうでわ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "트레이너의 기력과 체력을\n사용해서 포켓몬이 Z파워를\n발산할 수 있게 하는 신비한 팔찌.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "透過使用訓練家的\n氣力和體力來讓寶可夢\n釋放出Ｚ力量的神奇手環。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bracelet mystérieux utilisant la force vitale\ndu Dresseur pour permettre à ses Pokémon\nd’utiliser la Force Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein wundersames Armband, das die geistige und\nkörperliche Kraft eines Trainers nutzt, um bei\neinem Pokémon die Z-Kraft freizusetzen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misteriosa pulsera que transmite la fuerza física y\nmental del Entrenador a sus Pokémon, lo que les\npermite usar movimientos Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bracciale misterioso che trasmette le energie\nmentali dell’Allenatore ai suoi Pokémon,\npermettendo loro di sfruttare il Potere Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious ring that enables Pokémon to use\nZ-Power. It requires both the willpower and\nthe physical power of the Trainer wearing it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "トレーナーの　気力　体力を\n使って　ポケモンが　Ｚパワーを\n放てるようにする　不思議な腕輪。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
